## Constructor matched twice in the same case

```catala
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A
  -- B
  -- F

declaration scope S:
  context e content E
  output o content integer

scope S:
  definition e equals A
  definition o equals match e with pattern
    -- A or B or A: 1
    -- F: 2
```

